  "captions": {
    "covariance-learning": "Covariance learning and mixture fitting for 24 constructed rows in three conditions. (a\u2013c) An equal-effects pattern, the second principal-component pattern and its extreme-deconvolution refinement; each displayed matrix is divided by its largest diagonal entry. (d) Fitted mixture weights summed over covariance sources, including the global null. (e) Observed-data log likelihood during covariance learning on 16 strong rows, stopping at the 300-iteration limit. (f) The mixture objective fitted on all 24 rows. The input table is illustrative; these traces do not measure statistical calibration.",
    "posterior-summary": "Posterior summaries for the same fixed input. (a) Supplied estimates $\\hat b_{jr}$ and (b) posterior means $\\hat{\\hat b}_{jr}$ use a common color scale. (c) Pairwise magnitude sharing among rows with lfsr < 0.05 in either condition; shared posterior means have equal signs and magnitudes within a factor of two. (d) Posterior means and 95% equal-tail intervals in condition 1 for six specified rows. (e) The corresponding summaries of $b_{j1}-b_{j2}$. (f) Supplied estimates versus posterior means in all three conditions. Intervals condition on the fitted covariance patterns and mixture weights."
  },
